{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Keep recycling - new challenges, containers, improved models, more management and much more.</strong></i><br><i><strong></strong></i><br><i><strong>Design and expand your new recycling center in this first-person simulation game. Take care of unloading, sorting and compacting the waste.</strong>  </i><br><i> </i><br><i><strong>The new level editor allows you to freely design the yard, place upgrades and set it up the way you like.</strong> </i><br><i>  </i><br><i><strong>With increasing experience, multiple customers will show up simultaneously and might create a queue if unloading does not happen fast enough.</strong> </i><br><i>  </i><br><i><strong>Completely new shaders for containers and vehicles bring realistic graphics and more possibilities. You can not only clean containers with the pressure washer but also restore old paint jobs with the new paint gun. </strong> </i><br><i>  </i><br><strong><i>If you don't take care of the compactors, they can wear off and stop working properly. </i></strong><i> </i><br><i>  </i><br><i><strong>New ways to sell used goods like furniture and electronics: The enlarged second-hand shop and new advertisement signs attract customers. </strong> </i><br><i>  </i><br><i><strong>New human and vehicle 3D models with many variations in clothing and style will keep unloading and sorting the trash interesting.</strong></i><br><i><strong></strong></i><br><i><strong>More information soon!</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Randomly generated customers</strong> and trash objects </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Authentic animation of <strong>garbage compactors</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Unload and sort</strong> customer's trash </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic <strong>containers and machines</strong> for different types of trash </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Buy, paint and configure</strong> new containers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Restore and sell <strong>second hand</strong> items and <strong>save them</strong> from the crusher </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Waste paper, bulky trash, recyclables, scrap metal and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use the management to <strong>configure the yard</strong> the way you like </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Earn cash and satisfaction to <strong>unlock new trash types and containers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Purchase upgrades</strong> for machines and containers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use the <strong>pressure washer</strong> to clean the containers</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3343920?t=1757158003","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3343920?t=1757158003","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343920/72de7737478ff15c287daa8e60baf3daee8aebed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757158003","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343920/72de7737478ff15c287daa8e60baf3daee8aebed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757158003","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Keep recycling - new challenges, containers, improved models, more management and much more.</strong></i><br><i><strong></strong></i><br><i><strong>Design and expand your new recycling center in this first-person simulation game. Take care of unloading, sorting and compacting the waste.</strong>  </i><br><i> </i><br><i><strong>The new level editor allows you to freely design the yard, place upgrades and set it up the way you like.</strong> </i><br><i>  